profile: runtime-mirust.retired-long-term-memory.v1
updated_utc: 2026-07-02T00:00:00Z

current_truth:
  Runtime.MiRust.com is retired as a separate documentation authority.
  TinyRustLM.MiRust.com is the current developer documentation portal.
  TinyRustLM.com is the current browser-local Rust/WASM app.

preserved_memory:
  index: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/index.md
  manifest: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/MANIFEST.md
  local_archive: E:\Source\Rust\TinyRustLM.MiRust.com\docs\runtime-portal\
  note: The former long-term Runtime.MiRust.com memory body is preserved in the TinyRustLM legacy runtime archive.

redirect_behavior:
  root: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/developer-portal/
  docs_prefix: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/runtime-docs/
  llms_txt: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/llms.txt
  llms_full_txt: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/llms-full.txt

boundaries:
  - Project servers do not run user model bytes.
  - Project servers do not serve runnable user model bytes.
  - Browser-local model use must come from user-selected local files or user-selected third-party routes.
  - Historical Runtime.MiRust.com claims must be read through the preserved archive, not treated as current product authority.
